# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# web/sqlite3.wasm and web/sqflite_sw.js, from `dart run
# sqflite_common_ffi_web:setup`, are tracked: the setup builds its worker
# with a freshly resolved webdev/build_runner, which broke in October 2026
# (build_runner 2.16.1 against analyzer 14.5.0) and stopped every web build.
# CI runs the setup only when a file is missing.

# Ship targets are web and Android. `flutter create` regenerates these four
# every time a plugin with a desktop or iOS implementation is added, and
# every one of those regenerations is a diff nobody reads about a platform
# nobody builds. They were tracked once and are ignored now.
/ios/
/linux/
/macos/
/windows/
